#: hlidskjalf/chatview.py:167
msgid ""
"Saga keeps the chat keys of this device in the system keyring (Secret "
"Service). Install and unlock a keyring – e.g. GNOME Keyring (package gnome-"
"keyring) or KWallet – and start Saga again. Until then the keys are only "
"kept until Saga is closed; after that, this device needs the recovery key or "
"another device again."
msgstr ""
"Saga guarda las claves de chat de este dispositivo en el llavero del sistema "
"(Secret Service). Instala y desbloquea un llavero, p. ej. GNOME Keyring "
"(paquete gnome-keyring) o KWallet, y vuelve a abrir Saga. Hasta entonces las "
"claves solo se conservan hasta cerrar Saga; después, este dispositivo "
"necesitará de nuevo la clave de recuperación u otro dispositivo."

